      Open source intelligence practitioner working toward mission-driven
      analyst work — researching in the open, writing about what I learn,
      and aiming those skills at the fight against human trafficking.
    </p>
    <div class="portfolio-stats" data-reveal>
      <div class="portfolio-stat">
        <b class="stat-number" data-count="3">3</b><span>Certifications</span>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-stat">
        <b class="stat-number" data-count="4">4</b><span>Roles &amp; programs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="portfolio-stat">
        <b class="stat-number" data-count="2">2</b><span>Projects</span>
