    <ul class="portfolio-list">
      <li>
        <strong>Expert, Loyalty — T-Mobile</strong> (2025–present; previously Technical Expert, 2024–2025)
        <br />Customer care and technical support in a high-volume call center environment.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Volunteer OSINT Analyst — Skull Games Task Force</strong> (since October 2026)
        <br />Volunteer analyst supporting counter-trafficking operations.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>OSINT Intern — The OSINT Insider</strong> (since September 2026)
